OL,3,GNEWSATom Hardy spoof brought me huge
OL,4,AInstagram following
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had no clue how to work it," says
OL,7,FClare Eaton of her first attempts at
OL,8,Fposting on Instagram, initially needing
OL,9,Fhelp from her children to get to grips
OL,10,Fwith reels.
OL,12,FBut the fitness instructor who creates
OL,13,Fcontent for other mid-life women said
OL,14,Fher social media following took off
OL,15,Fafter a spoof post about the actor Tom
OL,16,FHardy.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
